mponents/alert#examples","content":"import { Meta, ArgTypes } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\nimport { Examples } from '@bento/storybook-addon-helpers/runtime';\nimport * as Stories from './"},"84":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-19","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"Alert positions and styles its regions. You supply the regions."},"85":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-20","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Compose siblings inside Alert**: optional `Icon slot=\"indicator\"`, `Content` for the title and body, optional `ButtonGroup`, and optional `CloseButton`. Use `Button slot=\"close\"` when the dismiss control needs a visible label. Pass `onPress` on the close control and hide the alert from the parent."},"86":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-21","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Name the title with a slot**: `Heading slot=\"title\"`, or `Text slot=\"title\"` when heading semantics do not fit. Body copy is an unslotted `Text` inside `Content`."},"87":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-22","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Choose the glyph on Icon**: for example `<Icon slot=\"indicator\" icon=\"alert\" />`. The indicator is decorative. Omit it when the message stands alone. Override its size with `style` when you need a different dimension than Alert's default."},"88":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-23","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Keep region roots as direct children of Alert.** Return several regions from a fragment when you extract them. An extra DOM wrapper is not placed in the layout grid. Put custom layout inside `Content` instead."},"89":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-24","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Child props win** over Alert's context defaults. Classes merge. Local style properties win over context styles."},"90":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-25","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**`Content` has no inset inside Alert.** The surface owns padding. Override `Content` spacing only when a custom interior needs it."},"91":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-26","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Surface props stay on Alert**: `className`, `style`, `ref`, native attributes, and `data-emphasis` for theming."},"92":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-27","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"**Narrow containers stack actions** under the content and keep the close control in its own column. Empty icon and close columns collapse. Source order remains the keyboard order."},"93":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-28","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#customization","content":"Alert owns region contexts the way overlay shells do, so a nested Alert does not pick up a parent Modal or Card `Content` padding. Only `IconContext` is merged from outside, so ambient icons and `CloseButton` keep parent icon customization. Unslotted icons do not receive the indicator defaults."},"94":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-29","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#keyboard","content":"| Key             | Description                                           |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Tab / Shift+Tab | Moves between controls in the consumer's source order |","table":"table-0"},"95":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-30","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#keyboard","content":"| Key           | Description                  |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| Enter / Space | Activates the focused button |","table":"table-0"},"96":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-31","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#screen-readers","content":"The surface defaults to `role=\"alert\"`, an assertive live region. Use `role=\"status\"` for polite updates when appropriate. Screen reader announcements depend on how content enters or updates the live region; rendering an SSR snapshot does not verify an announcement."},"97":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-32","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#screen-readers","content":"Choose the `Heading` level for the surrounding page. The `title` slot styles the title but does not set `aria-labelledby` or `aria-describedby` on `Alert`. Add explicit labeling attributes when the surface needs an accessible name. `CloseButton` defaults to `aria-label=\"Close\"`; set `aria-label` directly on that button for localization or more context."},"98":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-33","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#screen-readers","content":"The parent controls visibility and focus restoration after dismissal. An `Alert` inside a `Modal` owns a separate close slot, so its close button does not inherit the `Modal`'s dismiss handler. The enclosing dialog keeps its own title."},"99":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-34","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","content":"Explain what happened and how the user can respond."},"100":{"id":"/docs/components/alert-35","page_id":"/docs/components/alert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/alert#best-practices","con