 | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Typeahead (letters) | Jumps to the item matching the typed letter |","table":"table-0"},"970":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-33","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Menu accessible name**: Set `aria-label` on the `<Menu>` to name the list (e.g., \"Actions\", \"Share with\"). This is separate from any `Heading` title in the popover."},"971":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-34","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Roles**: Single-select items use `menuitemradio`; multiple-select use `menuitemcheckbox`. Unselectable items use `menuitem`."},"972":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-35","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Selection indicators are decorative**: A checkbox, radio check, or chevron-right icon is purely visual. The item owns the `aria-checked` state."},"973":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-36","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#aria","content":"**Group headings**: The group `Heading` receives `role=\"presentation\"` automatically and acts as a label for the group, not a real heading level."},"974":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-37","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Title placement**: Place an optional `Heading` as a sibling to `Menu`, not wrapped inside (do not use `slot=\"title\"`; see \"Title and groups\" example)."},"975":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-38","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Menu name**: Set `aria-label` on `<Menu>` to name the list (\"Actions\", \"Share with\", \"Theme\")."},"976":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-39","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Stable IDs**: Give each `MenuItem` a unique `id` for React tracking across re-renders."},"977":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-40","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Typeahead**: For composed labels (icons, checkboxes), provide `textValue` to `MenuItem` for typeahead search."},"978":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-41","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Selection modes**: Set `selectionMode` on `Menu` (all items) or per-`MenuGroup` (only group). Use controlled state for tracking."},"979":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-42","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Submenus**: Use `SubmenuTrigger` with `chevron-right` icon. Keyboard navigation is automatic."},"980":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-43","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Mobile**: Replace `MenuTrigger` + `Popover` with `Drawer` on narrow viewports; reuse the same `Menu`."},"981":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-44","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"**Avoid complex content**: Forms, date pickers, and multi-line content belong in a separate overlay, not in menu items."},"982":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"page","content":"MetricsLockup","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup"},"983":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup-0","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","content":"The MetricsLockup component displays a single metric with an optional title, info tooltip, trend indicator, and description."},"984":{"id":"/docs/compon