-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key                    | Action                                                       |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Arrow Left / Right** | Move focus between items (RAC automatically reverses in RTL) |","table":"table-0"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-30","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key               | Action                  |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------- |\n| **Space / Enter** | Toggle the focused item |","table":"table-0"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-31","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key      | Action                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **Home** | Move focus to the first item |","table":"table-0"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-32","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#keyboard-navigation","content":"| Key     | Action                      |\n| ------- | --------------------------- |\n| **End** | Move focus to the last item |","table":"table-0"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-33","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"single\"` → `role=\"radiogroup\"` on container, `role=\"radio\"` + `aria-checked` per item"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-34","page_id":"/docs/components/toggle-button","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toggle-button#aria-support","content":"`selectionMode=\"multiple\"` → `role=\"toolbar\"` on container, `role=\"button\"` + `aria-pressed` per item"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/components/toggle-button-35","page_id":"/doc